# Anything listed here is not uploaded to Vercel, so it can never be served.
#
# docs/ is the project's own paper trail - PENDIENTES.md, the roadmap, design
# notes, and docs/mockups/*.html, which are static HTML. Vercel serves whatever
# static files it is given, so those mockups were reachable on the live domain
# by anyone who guessed the URL: a fake payments screen with "Coming soon"
# states, sitting on the same domain that takes real money. Nothing secret in
# them, but nothing that belongs in public either.
#
# The only reference to docs/ from runtime code is one comment in landing.html
# pointing at an audit file, which does not need the file to exist.
docs/

# Test and tooling output. Never needed at runtime, and playwright-report can
# carry screenshots of test runs.
tests/
e2e/
playwright-report/
playwright.config.js
test-results/

# Database migrations are run by hand in the Supabase SQL editor. Publishing
# them tells a reader the exact shape of every table.
scripts/*.sql
